# E §3.1 step 1, INTERFACE §1 (tally 2.1.6, issue #74): reprint of a joint model whose member a/a.tally is given
# but isn't the text its use line pins (amt = 2, pinned with amt = 1) refuses LOAD-PIN, as run does. tally 2.1.5's
# refcore printed both files and their hash.
=== options reprint
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "a/a.tally" sha256 "244e202f2765069c3eeedc89b40d367e39ee638acaea58bad6d4a488b90a6072"

ask x: a.twice
=== a/a.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "src"

input amt: int

def twice: int = amt + amt

ask q: twice

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 2
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PIN a/a.tally doesn't match its sha256 in use a
